title: The Wishing Font
portrait left: seeker

You wander into a room with a pool of clear water. As you get closer you realize there are hundreds of coins at the bottom. Perhaps you can make a wish.

choice:
  - [if gold >= 50] Throw in 50 gold -> wish
  - Leave -> leave

@wish
  > gold -50
  > card add random uncommon
  You throw in a handful of coins. After a moment you notice a card float up to the surface. 
  > end

@leave
  You decide the gold is better in your pocket than at the bottom of a pool.  
  > end
